- mjcf/mobile_fr3_duo.xml is copied from moveit_pro_franka_ws
  (src/mobile_fr3_duo_sim/mjcf/mobile_fr3_duo.xml at 940aa42), with the
  planar base travel widened for the store, and says so in a comment at its
  top. Its sources:
  - franka_description 2.9.0, Copyright 2023 Franka Robotics GmbH: the
    kinematics, inertials and dynamics of the FR3 v2 arms, spine, head and TMR
    base, converted by PickNik Inc.
  - MuJoCo Menagerie Franka FR3 model (franka_fr3): the actuator settings.
  - MuJoCo Menagerie Franka Emika Panda model (franka_emika_panda): the finger
    coupling (tendon and equality constraints) from its hand.xml.

- Robot meshes in mjcf/assets/:
  - finger_0.obj and finger_1.obj are copied unchanged from the MuJoCo
    Menagerie Franka Emika Panda model.
  - tmrv0_2_visual_red.obj, tmrv0_2_visual_black.obj,
    tmrv0_2_visual_white.obj, tmrv0_2_visual_yellow.obj and
    tmrv0_2_visual_grey.obj are converted by PickNik Inc. from franka_description
    2.9.0's franka_description/meshes/robots/tmrv0_2/visual/tmrv0_2.dae: split by
    material, scaled from millimetres to metres, with its texture coordinates,
    and all but the grey part decimated; each file's header says how.
  - The other robot meshes are not part of this package:
    mjcf/mobile_fr3_duo.xml loads them at run time from the vendored
    franka_description, through package://franka_description/meshes/... paths
    (src/external_dependencies/franka_config/franka_description/meshes/...).
